      ],
      "source": "https://www.robinsonchamber.com/visitor-information"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Heath Museum & Confectionary on the west side of the square showcases the region’s oil‑production history and confectionery craft.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
